PYCHARM_DEBUG=1 python backup.py --config /opt/backup/config.yaml
0 3 * * * /usr/bin/python3 /opt/backup/backup.py --config /opt/backup/config.yaml >> /var/log/backup.log 2>&1

Frappe mode
===========

Enable native Frappe backups in the configuration:

    frappe:
      enabled: true
      bench_dir: /home/frappe/frappe-bench
      site: erp.testpro.io

The utility runs this command before passing the result through the existing
local storage, remote upload, rotation, and alert pipeline:

    bench --site erp.testpro.io backup --with-files --compress --backup-path <work-dir>

Run the utility as the operating-system user that owns the Bench. The generic
`paths` and `db` sections are ignored while Frappe mode is enabled.
